{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_187_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_187","textTraditional":"一、六年，春，王正月，杞伯益姑卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_187_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_187","textTraditional":"二、葬秦景公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_187_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_187","textTraditional":"三、夏，季孫宿如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_187_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_187","textTraditional":"四、葬杞文公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_187_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_187","textTraditional":"五、宋華合比出奔衞。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_187_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_187","textTraditional":"六、秋，九月，大雩。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_187_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_187","textTraditional":"七、冬，楚，薳罷帥師伐吳。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_187_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_187","textTraditional":"八、叔弓如楚。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_187_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_187","textTraditional":"九、齊侯伐北燕。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}